{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30420","headline":"重阳日示舍弟 · 赵嘏","name":"重阳日示舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多少乡心入酒杯，野塘今日菊花开。\n新霜何处雁初下，故国穷秋首正回。\n渐老向人空感激，一生驱马傍尘埃。\n侯门无路提携尔，虚共扁舟万里来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}